{"availability":"available","full":"sshah03/perspica","name":"perspica","description":"Review code changes by what they do, not line by line.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":29,"forks":1,"created":"2026-09-30T20:04:09Z","updated":"2026-10-03T05:49:46Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://github.com/sshah03/perspica","topics":["code-review","coding-agents","diff","git","pull-requests","rust","semantic-diff","static-analysis","tree-sitter"],"demo":null,"color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z","stars":29,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Review code changes by what they do, not line by line.","perspica reads a diff the way a careful reviewer would. It parses both sides, works out what actually changed (a rename, a new parameter, a moved function, a real logic change), sets aside the mechanical noise (reformatting, comments, rename-only lines, unchanged moves, generated files), and points at what a plain diff hides: references to names that no longer exist, calls that weren't updated for a new signature, code left unused.","None of that needs a model. perspica parses both versions with tree-sitter and follows the calls between them, so it's one local binary that answers in a few hundred milliseconds on a typical PR, gives the same answer every time, and needs no API key. An LLM is an optional extra: it groups the changes by intent, rates the risk of each group and writes a summary, and nothing leaves your machine unless you ask for it."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sshah03/perspica/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"294da725b577c6e99230541abba17f9aba77cc1423f97888e9d857f24d6e4019","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T08:24:09.857Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:51.883Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Review code changes by what they do, not line by line.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sshah03/perspica/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"None of that needs a model. perspica parses both versions with tree-sitter and follows the calls between them, so it's one local binary that answers in a few hundred milliseconds on a typical PR, gives the same answer every time, and needs no API key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sshah03/perspica/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"The optional LLM analysis (-s, or Analyze… in the viewer) runs through Claude Code, an API key or Ollama; see LLM analysis for setup.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sshah03/perspica/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"Claude Code. perspica uses your Claude Code login, so no API key is needed; if you already use it, there's nothing to set up.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sshah03/perspica/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Install Claude Code and run claude auth login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sshah03/perspica/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"294da725b577c6e99230541abba17f9aba77cc1423f97888e9d857f24d6e4019","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sshah03/perspica/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:51.883Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T05:49:46Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:45.380Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/sshah03/perspica/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:51.884Z","hash":"294da725b577c6e99230541abba17f9aba77cc1423f97888e9d857f24d6e4019","originalBytes":13123,"storedBytes":13123,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["perspica","changes","code","file","claude","files","key","llm","model","what","analysis","api","diff","git","ollama","web"